    <Copyright URL="">Copyright © GemaGemia</Copyright>
    <Author URL="mailto:gemagemia.09@gmail.com">GemaGemia</Author>
    <Description URL="">Ĩno nĩ kanyakanya ya Gĩgĩkũyũ yaturirwo mwakainĩ wa 2026 AD. Ĩturĩtwo ĩteithĩrĩrie mwandĩki gũcana Gĩgĩkũyũ macini-inĩ. Haha ũgũkora ndemwa iria Gĩgĩkũyũ kĩhũthagĩra cia kĩ-ratini.
Kwa mũhiano, ndemwa ta q,p,s,f,l,z,x,v iria itahũthĩkaga kwandĩka Gĩgĩkũyũ itirĩ haha.
Na kũmenya maingĩ makĩria rũmĩrĩra mandĩko magũtaũra marĩa 
maratwarana na kanyakanya ĩno.</Description>
    <Version URL=""></Version>
